# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Line endings: this repo is LF everywhere (Unix tooling: GHDL, cocotb, make).
# Git normalizes to LF on commit and checks out LF on every platform.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
* text=auto eol=lf

# Binary assets: never touch (no EOL conversion, no diff).
*.png binary

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# GitHub Linguist: this is a VHDL project.
# The Python golden model + cocotb testbench and the plotting script are the
# verification/tooling harness, not the deliverable. Keep them in the repo but
# exclude them from the language statistics so the language bar reflects the RTL.
#   (Swap `linguist-vendored` for `linguist-documentation` below if you'd rather
#    keep the Python fully expanded in GitHub diffs; both exclude it from stats.)
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
*.py        linguist-vendored
tb/Makefile linguist-vendored

# Make sure the HDL is what gets counted.
*.vhd linguist-language=VHDL
